What is SIP Systems?
SIP Systems are communication solutions built on the Session Initiation Protocol, the industry standard signaling protocol that establishes, manages, and terminates real time sessions for voice, video and messaging over IP networks. By replacing traditional private branch exchange (PBX) infrastructure, SIP enables scalable, flexible unified communication environments, supports cloud native deployments, and integrates AI driven capabilities such as intelligent call routing and predictive maintenance.
